firsthand-brand/
brand/LOGO-PROMPTS.md
private/
notes/
scratch/
refs/

# ---- Sibyl Memory ---------------------------------------------------
# Machine-local and contains indexed counterparty data. Judges rebuild it
# with `observe.base --bootstrap`; it is never committed.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite*
.sibyl-memory/
# The working database, its journals, and the indexer cursor. Git cannot
# re-include a file under an excluded directory, so this excludes the contents
# rather than the directory and lets the deployment seed back in below.
data/*
# The one exception. Render and any other git-sourced build has no access to a
# gitignored file, so the record production serves has to be in the repository.
# Compressed: 1.1 MB against 4.5 MB, and it is a snapshot, not the live file.
# Refresh it with:  gzip -9 -c data/memory.db > data/memory.db.gz
!data/memory.db.gz
memory-snapshots/

